rks/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e8a8a612/uploads/origins/f2680a65-1977-4970-b9cf-9a1284b93b6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72673ba175cdcfd3ba04eef79e846e11", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e8a8a612/uploads/origins/f2680a65-1977-4970-b9cf-9a1284b93b6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72673ba175cdcfd3ba04eef79e846e11, https://si.imgix.net/e8a8a612/uploads/origins/f2680a65-1977-4970-b9cf-9a1284b93b6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6f57c430e0b4ca0c7014f0d7bfed193 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e8a8a612/uploads/origins/f2680a65-1977-4970-b9cf-9a1284b93b6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63159a99b09b499963cd36d29c019fcc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "老师晚上好～\n这次想麻烦老师画一下我家新孩子赛利亚。她是一个十分擅长舞蹈，对舞蹈有很高追求的舞者。\n\n她的发色是白色，瞳色是天蓝色。\n希望稿件能带个发型的差分。发型可以参考组合页稿件，那边有这孩子的散发版本和束发版本参考图。\n\n动作表情等都可以随意发挥～\n那就麻烦老师了！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1tKdVe7T1Qid-q3djsSvgCgh6oW-x63z1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xllkanaechu/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b578c74c/uploads/origins/54862dbe-08c1-49d4-ac60-cadc20768ba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52df4e6e43262c7c188af915941c5b20", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b578c74c/uploads/origins/54862dbe-08c1-49d4-ac60-cadc20768ba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52df4e6e43262c7c188af915941c5b20, https://si.imgix.net/b578c74c/uploads/origins/54862dbe-08c1-49d4-ac60-cadc20768ba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ce47a661d47d8a9aafa7447aeb097e2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b578c74c/uploads/origins/54862dbe-08c1-49d4-ac60-cadc20768ba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2d1858dc47bdf1af7712b33ecabe583 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "深夜打搅了~这次想请老师画我家的双胞胎。\n\n两姐妹都是独眼的，瞳色分别对应对方的发色。\n两人都很畏光，平时也都戴着眼纱。妹妹（黑皮那位）比姐姐更畏光，一直都闭眼。\n性格上姐姐比较活泼健谈，妹妹则沉默寡言像个玩偶儿一样。\n\n两姐妹的感情很好，可以的话想画两姐妹互动（比如姐姐帮妹妹编发之类的）\n麻烦老师啦！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1oWgHIfrW13-MXR_UW6HTHZZXN8jdxQQr", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xllkanaechu/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de9aa79dd980fc782607586df5a57664", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de9aa79dd980fc782607586df5a57664, https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d46488152ecbcad2a80bc26a48ffcd12 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f831a72217cfd50ea9c0dec779a5be63 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "很高兴见到你，我叫 Nimicha，Vtuber。\n我在 skeb 上看到了你的插图。\n我是 Vtuber，我在 skeb 上看过你的插图。\n\n请求详情\n这次我想让你为我自己画一幅插图。\n我希望她穿着巫师形象的服装，而不是她原来的服装。我没有任何参考服装，所以就交给 Shuichi 大小姐了.....！\n你还可以改变发型等等。\n\nReference URL: https://twitter.com/nimi_pyon/status/1673294208994791425?s=46&t=5wXFm7mc_X1Lsm7gT91CWg\n\n预期用途\n可用于以下用途。\n用于 Twitter 等各种社交网络服务。\n在 YouTube 视频、视频发布和 VTuber 活动中使用缩略图。\n用于商品生产等商业用途。\n\n构图\n如果插图为 16:9，我们会很高兴，因为我们也希望将其用于壁纸。如果难度太大，也没关系！\n如果您能将姿势等交给我处理，我将不胜感激。\n如果您能尽可能提供差异等信息，我会非常高兴。\n\n其他\n如果可能，我们希望插图的尺寸大一些。\n我们希望收到透明的插图。\n\n如果可能的话，我希望您能把我画得看不见。\n如果由于设计原因难以做到，也没关系！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xllkanaechu/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/adb5dae1/uploads/origins/51bacd29-0f82-4b70-86d8-83538794788f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3f178dfe51ab091b4932dfcf14d263af", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adb5dae1/uploads/origins/51bacd29-0f82-4b70-86d8-83538794788f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3f178dfe51ab091b4932dfcf14d263af, https://si.imgix.net/adb5dae1/uploads/origins/51bacd29-0f82-4b70-86d8-83538794788f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=57800b09cb360c2d0b3d7e49eb1ace24 2x, https://si.imgix.net/adb5dae1/uploads/origins/51bacd29-0f82-4b70-86d8-83538794788f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=10788074dcf72cb9efc9e8be8d931b45 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xllkanaechu/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5ec6734f/uploads/origins/288ff323-fe40-47e4-abe7-53fcbdf3bd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5eb8a4654ec212202e67883f9eb05c1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5ec6734f/uploads/origins/288ff323-fe40-47e4-abe7-53fcbdf3bd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5eb8a4654ec212202e67883f9eb05c1, https://si.imgix.net/5ec6734f/uploads/origins/288ff323-fe40-47e4-abe7-53fcbdf3bd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=452034196354ae5f7caecf9d6c74cba2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5ec6734f/uploads/origins/288ff323-fe40-47e4-abe7-53fcbdf3bd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03c2e115e22f5941cd12a0fde5a969d6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "修一老师您好，非常喜欢您的画，想要给我的oc约一张，拜托啦！\n\n她是一位猫娘，年龄19岁，黑发，异色瞳（左眼紫 右眼蓝）。性格温柔安静，喜欢读书和甜点，是一位正在学习魔法的贵族大小姐。她的武器是魔法书和羽毛笔，她有一只宝石兽一直陪伴她长大，她们是最好的伙伴。\n\n人设参考资料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/133o0YrdJkezXAqcCX5PbvC_8Axw40WJ8\n\n拆分服设有好几种组合方式，老师按照自己的喜好自由选择就可以。其他的构图，姿势和表情都交给老师自由发挥就可以啦！需要注意一下的就是她的猫耳比一般猫耳要稍微细长一些，参考立绘就可以。\n\n谢谢！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/133o0YrdJkezXAqcCX5PbvC_8Axw40WJ8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xllkanaechu/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c76dcd80/uploads/origins/195e6598-533a-4689-93fb-300aff74e2b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a876d79e518daffb71cf25fa5903b7ce", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c76dcd80/uploads/origins/195e6598-533a-4689-93fb-300aff74e2b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a876d79e518daffb71cf25fa5903b7ce, https://si.imgix.net/c76dcd80/uploads/origins/195e6598-533a-4689-93fb-300aff74e2b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9721131ca4f2ca57d37be8b81d123eca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c76dcd80/uploads/origins/195e6598-533a-4689-93fb-300aff74e2b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3946754d87894f063368886a0d44c5f4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "很高兴见到你，我的名字是希娜。\n你的艺术是非常美丽的。我想让你为我的Ori角色绘制插图。\n\n她是一名高中生，喜欢漂亮的东西。\n眼睛颜色：红色(#d7003a)\n头发颜色：月白色/白靛色（#dff2fc）\n\n请自由发挥，画出她的表情、姿势等。\n衣服：我想要求的是 \"花 \"的那件。\n\n这是供个人观赏的。\n谢谢你考虑我的要求。如果你对价格或要求有任何问题，请毫不犹豫地拒绝，谢谢。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1_A3O-qHBYgHiK-frrHdcZBbJ1s7FZOIw", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}